{"type":"message","id":"4ee40b36","parentId":"5120d2a8","timestamp":"2026-04-24T11:08:35.508Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All web search attempts have failed. Let me try to use firecrawl or tavily search skills since they might have different search backends. Let me also try to check if there's a memory or knowledge I can use.\n\nActually, let me try the tavily-search skill or firecrawl skill. But first, let me give an answer based on my training knowledge about popular API relay services in China.\n\nThe commonly known Chinese API relay/proxy services include:\n\n1. **API2D** (api2d.com) - One of the most well-known, supports OpenAI, Claude, Gemini etc.\n2. **OpenAI-SB** (openai-sb.com) - Popular choice\n3. **GPT-API** (gpt-api.com) - Well known\n4. **AiHubMix** (aihubmix.com) - Comprehensive\n5. **CloseAI** (closeai.org) - Known for OpenAI models\n6. **OhMyGPT** - Popular\n7. **New API** / **one-api** - Self-hosted relay frameworks\n8. **AIChat** (aichatos.com) - Also known\n9. **KeyPool** - For managing API keys\n10. **OpenCat** \n\nLet me try one more search to get current status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_KIFtC48TtyKoBY8EQ42qywOQ","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/songquanpeng/one-api","maxChars":3000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":186,"output":609,"cacheRead":34176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34971,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777028907454,"responseId":"6b3c412e-88cb-43c2-83cd-8df420dcd6e2"}}
